{
  "title": "Player AoE art pass (Act I and shared: spells, summons, abilities)",
  "note": "Images are the pieces at 1x and 4x nearest-neighbour (strips also as 4x GIFs on the Graveyard soil). The game builds every ground effect from these pieces at 1:1 (rings of crests turned outward, puffs scattered over the area, lane tiles), so the drawn area matches the hit radius at any size; see sheet_* for the composed effects rendered in the engine at game size, and the before / after crops for the same seeded autotest moments in play (1280x720 windowed under xvfb; small camera-shake offsets between the two runs are the shake, not the art).",
